        "content": "<p>Does this help? <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1097608\">@Jiaxi Mo</span> <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/master/Mathlib/RepresentationTheory/Subrepresentation.lean\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/master/Mathlib/RepresentationTheory/Subrepresentation.lean</a></p>",
