    {
        "content": "<p>Actually I've tried every lemma manually before I asked, and the lemmas there all have the tag @[simp] or @[simps]. So, if they work in a naive way, simp should close the goal. I would be happy to be told if the above lemma can be proved without unfolding definition.</p>",
